@1 = ~Vincenzo is an amazing innkeeper, trust me. He takes good care of his guests, but the meat he serves is... raw. Simply raw! The last stew I had here gave me food poisoning. If you have any meat I could cook myself, I'd be willing to pay you for it. I don't want to hurt his feelings. He takes criticism terribly.~
@2 = ~I have some meat. Will you pay 89 gold for it?~
@3 = ~Please, do not mention this to Vincenzo.~
